{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":17,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"f2989e52-33ef-4067-96a5-5ad639f1daf9","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351541009,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"工艺工程师","OrgId":2527107,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.能独立完成半导体设备的开发及调试工作；\n2.记录工艺开发调试过程，并完成报告的撰写，对遇到的问题提出改善意见；\n3.对设备能够进行日常维护和定期保养，确保良好的设备条件；\n4.当设备生产产品出现异常时，能及时找出问题的根源并予以解决；\n5.能和客户进行良好的沟通，对客户提出的问题及时无误的进行反馈；\n6.能对兄弟部门人员或客户进行操作和工艺方面的培训。","Require":"1.硕士及以上学历理工科专业；\n2.英语国家四级及以上；\n3.善于口头和书面表达，熟悉掌握办公软件；\n4.喜欢半导体行业，可在无尘室工作；\n5.为人平和，性格沉稳不急躁、踏实肯干、吃苦耐劳、抗压能力强、有良好的学习能力、沟通能力与团队合作精神。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"1","ChangeDate":"2026-03-05T13:03:06","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"65da71ac-6532-4014-9523-7568fc1a4529","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351541008,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"机械工程师","OrgId":2527107,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.负责公司产品共性问题、关键部件问题的跟踪与分析，分析问题根源、认清工作机理；\n2.针对存在问题的部件进行技术改进、优化设计、测试验证，提升性能与可靠性；\n3.解决问题过程形成的技术方法形成专利；\n4.参与部分新项目的研发；\n5.产品机械结构、机械部件的设计、材料选用；\n6.产品机械结构的仿真模拟；\n7.与电气工程师配合完成产品电气设计；\n8.整理技术文献编写技术文档。","Require":"1.硕士及以上学历；机械、机电专业；\n2.专业领域具有较强创新能力；\n3.具备机械结构设计、测试分析相关项目经验；\n4.具有良好的团队合作精神；\n5.熟悉非标自动化设备结构设计、加工工艺、熟悉气动、液压设计；\n6.了解常见金属、非金属材料加工工艺；\n7.熟练使用机械绘图软件和编写技术标准。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"2","ChangeDate":"2026-03-05T13:01:33","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"30b7c2fb-fb1a-49e7-a7eb-ed3b3e68dd1a","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351541265,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"算法工程师","OrgId":2527107,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.负责半导体芯片制造中，光学膜厚（Optical Thickness）、关键尺寸（CD, Critical Dimension）量测相关算法的研发、设计与优化，聚焦量测精度、速度及稳定性提升，适配先进制程（如7nm及以下）量测需求；\n2.基于光学量测原理（如椭偏法、反射光谱法、散射法等），构建并迭代膜厚、关键尺寸的数学模型，解决量测过程中的非线性、多解性、噪声干扰等核心技术难题；\n3.参与量测系统的算法验证与落地，配合硬件团队完成算法与设备的集成调试，针对实测数据优化算法参数，确保算法满足量产检测的工程化要求；\n4.跟踪半导体量测领域前沿技术（如AI驱动量测、高精度光学建模），开展技术预研与创新，撰写相关技术专利、论文及研发报告。\n5.与跨部门（硬件、测试、产品）协作，梳理量测场景需求，将算法研发成果转化为可落地的技术方案，支撑产品迭代与市场拓展；\n6.参与学术交流与技术研讨，提升团队整体算法研发能力，助力公司在半导体量测领域的技术领先性。","Require":"1.应届博士毕业，光学工程、应用物理、半导体物理、电子科学与技术、计算机科学与技术、数学（应用数学、计算数学）等相关专业；\n2.精通半导体光学量测原理，深入理解椭偏法、反射光谱法、傅里叶变换红外光谱等至少一种量测技术，有膜厚、关键尺寸量测相关研究背景者优先；\n3.具备扎实的数学基础，熟练掌握数值计算、优化算法、矩阵分析、概率论与数理统计，能独立构建复杂光学量测模型；\n4.熟悉半导体制造工艺（如光刻、刻蚀、薄膜沉积），了解先进制程（7nm/5nm）量测痛点与行业标准者优先；\n5.掌握至少一种编程语言（Python/C++/MATLAB），具备算法编程、数据处理与仿真能力，有机器学习、深度学习在光学量测中应用经验者优先；\n6.熟悉RCWA严格耦合波分析计算及OCD建模优先。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"3","ChangeDate":"2026-03-05T15:58:23","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"574cd27d-cec2-4de9-b531-3bea7442525a","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351541274,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"电子工程师","OrgId":2527107,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.PCB硬件设计：根据研发需要研发PCB电路板硬件；                \n2.嵌入式系统软件设计：ARM、DSP、FPGA等嵌入式系统程序开发及持续改进                \n3.模拟或数字电路定制功能开发：根据研发需要定制特定功能的模电或数电集成电路板及成套装置；","Require":"1. 硕士及以上学历，电气工程及其自动化、控制工程专业；\n2.熟悉模拟和数字电路及其常用元器件；\n3.熟悉常用示波器，信号源，频谱仪，波形发生器，数电，模电等常用硬件测试仪器的使用；\n4.有实际PCB硬件系统研发经验；\n5.掌握至少一种EDA软件，比如altium Designer或者PADS；\n6.熟练运用一种IDE软件进行嵌入式软件开发；\n7.能根据需求独立完成功能明确的嵌入式系统硬件和软件开发。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"4","ChangeDate":"2026-03-05T16:03:34","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"1dd2724a-edc6-41d5-94db-a5d614153ad5","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351541258,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"清洗技术工程师","OrgId":2527107,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.开展半导体晶圆清洗工艺研究，包括新型清洗溶液调配验证，优化各类晶圆（尤其是Cu表面）污染物去除能力；\n2.联合设备研发人员开展清洗工艺验证，配合设计人员开展设备改进优化。","Require":"1.硕士或以上学历，化学类背景，具有半导体湿法化学工艺研发经验优先；\n2.有较强分析问题能力、并能提出创新性解决方案者优先；\n3.具有良好的英文沟通